@startuml
actor "Invited Person" as Person
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Nexo API" as API
Person -> UI: Submit account details
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /accounts/activation (ActivateAccountDto)
activate API
API --> UI: 200 OK (AccountDto) or 400/403/409
deactivate API
UI --> Person: Show result and sign in on success
deactivate UI
@enduml
